// DARKASTORIA_CEREMONY_INCANTATION_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1215191086" "I call to the spirit world for strength!"
// DARKASTORIA_CEREMONY_INCANTATION_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1846083437" "Spirit that strikes wounds, I call to you."
// DARKASTORIA_CEREMONY_INCANTATION_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3183884463" "I call to the sleeper below."
// DARKASTORIA_CEREMONY_INCANTATION_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1383738411" "That which was imprisoned, that which brings decay, I call to you!"
// DARKASTORIA_CEREMONY_INCANTATION_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1714759493" "Break the cage and free the the hungering sleeper!"

// SACRIFICE_OBSERVER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1996017921" "An intruder on our rites!"
// SACRIFICE_OBSERVER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1210859650" "Kill! Sacrifice the interloper!"
// SACRIFICE_OBSERVER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4055247103" "Our rites are not for your eyes."
// SACRIFICE_OBSERVER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3179026263" "Our master calls for your death!"
// SACRIFICE_OBSERVER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4174667699" "You shall die!"

// SACRIFICE_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1710534866" "Somebody help me!"
// SACRIFICE_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P809573457" "Let me go!"
// SACRIFICE_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1477763291" "Release me, you monsters!"
// SACRIFICE_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P706901793" "Saints preserve me!"
// SACRIFICE_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3562234103" "I need a hero!"
// SACRIFICE_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2969314449" "Please!  Somebody!  Please help me!"
// SACRIFICE_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2805812335" "Noooooo!  Stop this!  You must stop this!"

// SACRIFICE_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P2152292982" "Thank you. They were going to kill me! Or worse!"
// SACRIFICE_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P4158551269" "That was a bit too exciting."
// SACRIFICE_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P1595757689" "I think I better file a report with MAGI."
// SACRIFICE_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P686230793" "That was totally insane!  I'm so glad you showed up when you did!"
// SACRIFICE_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P1129446822" "Th-They were going to sacrifice me!  Thank you so much for saving me!"
// SACRIFICE_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P3264957707" "There are no words that do my appreciation justice!"

